  "name": "30th Celebration FUTURISTIC BOX",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A 30th anniversary box released on 16 September 2026 in Japan as the 30th CELEBRATION FUTURISTIC BOX and in mainland China as 30周年庆典 幻彩未来纪念礼盒. It held two premium foil Pikachu ex promos, one of each, drawn by the graphic artist YOSHIROTTEN in the Futuristic rare style (131 and 132/M-P in Japanese, 030 and 031/30th-P in Simplified Chinese), with coins, metal damage-counter dice, metal markers, sleeves, a deck case, a playmat and a display frame. It had no booster packs.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Inside Games: 30th CELEBRATION FUTURISTIC BOX",
        "url": "https://www.inside-games.jp/article/2026/06/06/182538.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: 30周年庆典 幻彩未来纪念礼盒",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/22308.html"
      }
    ]
  },
